#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
msgstr "Voer in hoeveel dae, weke of maande waarskuwingsgeskiedenis behou moet word, of kies Onbepaald om alles te behou (die getal word dan geïgnoreer). Maksimum 3650 dae, 520 weke of 120 maande. 'n Skoonmaaktaak loop saam met die Cacti-poller en verwyder verouderde gebeurtenisse saam met hul besluite, aflewerings en pogings. Aktiewe toestande en werk in die waglys of wat misluk het word nooit skoongemaak nie. Elke versamelaar maak sy eie geskiedenis skoon."

